# EVERY secret and setting this project reads from the environment, in one place.
# Nothing here is a real value. The real values go in the places named below, never in git.
#
# Each service reads its OWN .env file (the ones in services/*/ are ignored by git), so a key is only
# ever visible to the service that needs it. Each service also has its own, shorter .env.example.
# On Render there are no .env files: the verifier's values are typed into its Environment settings.
#
# Make a token:  python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"

# =============================================================== services/orchestrator/.env
# Where the two workers are. Locally you can leave both out (defaults: http://localhost:8001 and :8002).
# Deployed: the https address Render gave the verifier.
RESEARCHER_URL=
VERIFIER_URL=
# The token each worker expects. DIFFERENT from each other; each must match the worker's own copy.
RESEARCHER_TOKEN=
VERIFIER_TOKEN=
# The CrowdCampaign app, where run history and last run's top K are kept (the orchestrator uses its API only).
# The login below is the course's public grader account (not a personal secret), as in the 1B tracker.
CROWDCAMPAIGN_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
TRACKER_USERNAME=NYUgrader
TRACKER_PASSWORD=Courant2026!
# Optional: where to write the trace log (default: traces/orchestrator.jsonl).
# TRACE_FILE=

# =============================================================== services/researcher/.env
# RESEARCHER_TOKEN (same value as above)
# One model key is enough (the first one set is used):
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
# Web search (Tavily, free tier):
TAVILY_API_KEY=
# Optional: TRACE_FILE (default: traces/researcher.jsonl), PORT (default 8001), HOST (default 0.0.0.0)

# =============================================================== services/verifier/.env  (on Render: Environment settings)
# VERIFIER_TOKEN (same value as above)
# GEMINI_API_KEY or GROQ_API_KEY: one is enough. Use a different model from the researcher's if you can.
# Optional: TRACE_FILE (default: traces/verifier.jsonl locally, stdout only on Render), PORT (Render sets it), HOST

# =============================================================== backend/.env  (the CrowdCampaign app, Assignment 1)
# DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET and the rest are listed in backend/.env.example. They are not repeated here.
